{"id":"c7dd49fa09ccee1a","group":"58","path":"58/batch14/58-df-zfc-ord-regressive-function.md","title":"ZFC Ord Regressive Function","display":"df-zfc-ord-regressive-function — ZFC Ord Regressive Function","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-ord-regressive-function","aliases":["58-df-zfc-ord-regressive-function"],"display":"df-zfc-ord-regressive-function — ZFC Ord Regressive Function","depends_on":["[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-ord-regressive-function"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-ord-regressive-function</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-ord-regressive-function — ZFC Ord Regressive Function"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f,S\\in V\">\\(f,S\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}\\subseteq V\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>, <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a>).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcOrdRegressiveFunction}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcOrdRegressiveFunction}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ord\\text{-}regressive\\text{-}function} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrdRegressiveFunction}_S(f,S)\\leftrightarrow\n\\bigl(\\forall\\alpha\\in S\\;\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\bigr)\\land0\\notin S\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(f,S,\\bigcup S)\\land\n\\forall\\alpha\\in S\\;f(\\alpha)\\in\\alpha\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ord\\text{-}regressive\\text{-}function} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrdRegressiveFunction}_S(f,S)\\leftrightarrow\n\\bigl(\\forall\\alpha\\in S\\;\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\bigr)\\land0\\notin S\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(f,S,\\bigcup S)\\land\n\\forall\\alpha\\in S\\;f(\\alpha)\\in\\alpha\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Excluding <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span> makes the strict regressive inequality total on the domain; the function codomain is the set <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bigcup S\">\\(\\bigcup S\\)</span>, not the proper class of ordinals.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3$ and $\\mathrm{Ordinal}\\subseteq V$ (see [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]], [[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]).","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3$ and $\\mathrm{Ordinal}\\subseteq V$ (see [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]], [[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]).","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"f,S\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ordinal}\\subseteq V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcOrdRegressiveFunction}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ord\\text{-}regressive\\text{-}function} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrdRegressiveFunction}_S(f,S)\\leftrightarrow\n\\bigl(\\forall\\alpha\\in S\\;\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\bigr)\\land0\\notin S\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(f,S,\\bigcup S)\\land\n\\forall\\alpha\\in S\\;f(\\alpha)\\in\\alpha","display":true},{"tex":"0","display":false},{"tex":"\\bigcup S","display":false}],"bytes":1077,"backlinks":[{"id":"ec7b15e6613808fd","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2846","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-zfc-ord-regressive-function.md|58-df-zfc-ord-regressive-function]]（batch14）"}],"outgoing":["36d7463d215be751","5582a281f15a33c2"]}